        "params": {
          "text": "rlc impulse response\nRun 2 seconds at 1024 Hz, open response and analyze. omega0=2\u03c0\u00b75 rad/s, damping ratio=0.3.\nReusable schema contains two explicit Euler integrators; numerical frequency response follows that discretization.\nPhysical parameters and expected response: examples/frequency_response/README.md.",
